    thinking: "**Developing the Vision**\n\nOkay, I\'m envisioning the core architecture for a feature-rich Android app combining online and offline AI capabilities. It\'ll leverage a hybrid engine, gracefully handling both cloud-based (like Gemini) and local processing. This forms the foundation upon which everything else is built. I\'m focusing on defining core components for seamless functionality.\n\n\n**Defining Core Components**\n\nNow, I\'m fleshing out the specific components. I have a plan for the AI API, including streaming, multi-model options, reasoning, and web grounding. I\'m also planning offline AI, including a local neural assistant, sandbox and model manager, which covers both local and cloud-based models. I\'m focusing on their key elements and features.\n\n\n"
