    thinking: "**Organizing Data Entities**\n\nI\'m structuring the data entities for a new `com.example` package. I\'m focusing on a clean organization. Currently, I\'m defining a nested structure. This will include local data entities like `ChatSessionEntity.kt`, `ChatMessageEntity.kt`, `PersonaEntity.kt`, `AnalyticsLogEntity.kt`, and `Document`.\n\n\n**Refining Project Structure**\n\nI\'ve expanded the directory structure. I\'ve broken it down further, now including DAOs, remote data sources with models and a retrofit client, and repositories. I also added a `domain` module, including crypto for encryption, AI engines for reasoning and fallback, sync capabilities with connectivity monitoring, and voice interaction management. I am also working on adding the user interface elements.\n\n\n**Developing UI Components**\n\nI\'m now detailing the user interface elements. I\'m focusing on key screen implementations like `ChatScreen.kt` with reasoning and speech-to-text, and the `MultimodalScreen.kt`. The components include the `ModelSelectorDialog.kt`, allowing model switching, and more. I\'m also planning the `FlowDebateScreen.kt`, and the `AnalyticsScreen.kt` for tracking. Finally, I\'m defining a `ToolsAndPersonaScreen.kt`.\n\n\n"
