  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Hybrid AI Engine**\n\nI\'m currently architecting the `HybridAIEngine`. The logic now checks for online connectivity and the presence of an API key. I\'m building out the conditional flow to utilize Gemini\'s REST API if online, potentially alternating between models like `gemini-3.5-flash` or `gemini-3.1-pro-preview`, or defaulting to `gemini-pro`. Offline conditions are also being handled gracefully.\n\n\n"
