  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing UI Elements**\n\nOkay, I\'m diving into the UI layer now, working with Jetpack Compose and Material 3. I\'ve started defining color palettes in `Color.kt` and `Theme.kt`, focusing on a high-contrast AMOLED Dark scheme alongside a Modern Cyber Light option. The primary color is Electric Cyan. I\'m aiming for a visually striking and usable design.\n\n\n**Defining Color Schemes**\n\nI\'ve expanded the color palette to include secondary (`#8E2DE2`), accent (`#00FFA3`), dark surface (`#0D111A`), and card surface (`#161B26`) options, so the theme has a more complete look and feel. I am confident that these colors will enhance the user experience by giving a greater selection of UI elements and themes.\n\n\n**Developing App Screens**\n\nI am now focusing on the app\'s core screens. I\'ve been fleshing out `ChatScreen.kt` with multi-turn chat bubbles, and the Markdown-like typography looks good. I\'m also adding quick prompt suggestions. In `MultimodalScreen.kt`, I\'m developing both the Image Studio and Document Processing features. The FlowDebateScreen should be an interesting UI, with AI personas debating a topic step-by-step. I\'m starting the analytics dashboards next.\n\n\n"
