  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining View Models & UI**\n\nOkay, I\'m now focusing on designing `MainViewModel.kt` and `MainActivity.kt`. It looks like `MainViewModel` will need to manage the database instance using `AppDatabase.getDatabase(context)` and related repositories. Specifically, I\'m thinking it\'ll manage the chat repository instantiated by `chatRepository = ChatRepository(database.chatDao())` and a persona repository like `personaRepository = PersonaRepository(database.personaDao())`.\n\n\n**Expanding Data Access Layers**\n\nI\'ve added `analyticsRepository`, and `documentRepository` to the data layer. Now, I\'m integrating several domain managers: `hybridAIEngine`, `syncManager`, and `voiceInteractionManager`. I\'m also structuring the ViewModel with key state flows: `currentSessionId`, `messages`, `personas`, `activePersona`, `documents`, and several others related to analytics and user interactions like `isOnline`, `isProcessing`, and `voiceAmplitude`. Finally, the ViewModel will support operations to `sendMessage` and `createCustom`.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
